# Spider-Man, To the Rescue (flash): "When Spider-Man enters, you may tap him. When you do, another target nonattacking
# creature you control gains indestructible until end of turn." Cast after Bot1's Ornithopter attacks, so Memnite is the only
# creature the ability may target: not the attacking Ornithopter and not Spider-Man himself. He is tapped by his own ability
# (CR 603.12), and Memnite is indestructible that turn only.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Spider-Man, To the Rescue
Ornithopter
Memnite
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Man, To the Rescue.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Spider-Man, To the Rescue.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Indestructible
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Turn = 4
